# session handoff is personal (between sessions of the same author),
# not team content - EXCEPT tracked acceptance reports (wayfinder #49
# decision output), which ARE team deliverables and must be committed.
docs/handoff/*
!docs/handoff/*.md
# 019: i9 smoke acceptance reports (real-adapter e2e evidence) are team
# deliverables; without this, lint-staged's force-less git add re-stage
# fails because docs/handoff/* matches. Mirrors i4-smoke tracked files.
!docs/handoff/i9-smoke/
# 020: i10 CLI-harness smoke acceptance reports (real ask + chat-pipe e2e
# evidence) are team artifacts; un-ignore the dir so the reports track even
# though docs/handoff/* matches. Mirrors the i9-smoke exception above.
!docs/handoff/i10-smoke/
# 022: i11 session-api harness smoke acceptance reports (real serve-path
# e2e evidence) are team artifacts; un-ignore the dir so the reports track.
# Mirrors the i9-smoke / i10-smoke exceptions above.
!docs/handoff/i11-smoke/
# 118→132: i132 9router context-management passthrough probe (#132 wayfinder
# task resolution: SDK server-side edit reuse is dead because 9router routes
# to MiniMax M3, not Anthropic Claude; probe evidence is team artifact).
# Mirrors the i9/i10/i11-smoke exceptions above.
!docs/handoff/9router-context-mgmt-probe/

# 022: session-api runtime JSON store (data/sessions/<id>.json), not team
# content. The data/ top-level dir is kept via data/.gitkeep so the
# directory exists in checkout; only the runtime session files are excluded.
data/sessions/*

# 064 T5: JSONL trace output (default path ./trace.jsonl)
trace.jsonl

# local Next.js prototype (early-stage, not team-shared; built artifacts
# also covered by node_modules/ etc. above)
iknow-prototype/

# local archive of files removed/superseded during branch sync
_archive/

# .claude/ is personal tooling (hooks, rules, skills, settings);
# this is a personal project, not team-shared
.claude/
docs/kb-assistant-guide

# Narrow exception: project-level .claude/settings.json IS team-shared.
# The skill-routing-sync hook registration must be visible in every
# worktree checkout so skill-state stays in sync when working isolated.
# Git cannot re-include a file under an ignored dir directly, so we
# un-ignore the dir then re-ignore everything inside except settings.json.
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
.playwright-cli
.codebase-memory/

docs/harness-report

.reference/